    {
      "text": "You can schedule compliance summary reports for regular distribution to specified recipients."
    },
    {
      "text": "A warning icon appears next to the Schedule Name if there is an issue with the schedule scope (e.g., the Business Unit assigned to the scheduled report was deleted)."
    },
    {
      "text": "To schedule a compliance report:"
    },
    {
      "item": "Go to Administration > Scheduled Reports.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          20
        ],
        [
          23,
          40
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Click Add Schedule.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          18
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "See image."
    },
    {
      "item": "On the General Information tab:",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          7,
          26
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Schedule Name: Enter a unique name for the report.",
      "depth": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          13
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Format: Select either Excel or PDF.",
      "depth": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          6
        ],
        [
          22,
          27
        ],
        [
          31,
          34
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Benchmark: Select one or multiple active compliance benchmarks.",
      "depth": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          9
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Click Next.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 4,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          10
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "See image."
    },
    {
      "item": "On the Scope tab, use the following filter drop-down menus to focus on desired information:",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 5,
      "strong": [
        [
          7,
          12
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Business Units: Select one or multiple business units. Business units are logical groups of multiple cloud accounts.",
      "depth": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          14
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Clouds: Select one or multiple cloud service providers.",
      "depth": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          6
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Accounts: Select one or multiple cloud accounts.",
      "depth": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          8
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Regions: Select one or multiple regions",
      "depth": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          7
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "See image."
    },
    {
      "text": "To learn more about filters, see Using Filters."
    },
    {
      "item": "Click Next.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 6,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          10
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "On the Schedule tab:",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 7,
      "strong": [
        [
          7,
          15
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Frequency: Select a schedule as follows:",
      "depth": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          9
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Select Daily and select the time and timezone.",
      "depth": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          7,
          12
        ],
        [
          28,
          32
        ],
        [
          37,
          45
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Select Weekly and select the day, time, and timezone.",
      "depth": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          7,
          13
        ],
        [
          29,
          32
        ],
        [
          34,
          38
        ],
        [
          44,
          52
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Select Monthly and select the date, time, and timezone.",
      "depth": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          7,
          14
        ],
        [
          30,
          34
        ],
        [
          36,
          40
        ],
        [
          46,
          54
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Recipients: Enter the email addresses of the recipients.",
      "depth": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          10
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "See image."
    },
    {
      "item": "Click Next, then click Finish.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 8,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          10
        ],
        [
          23,
          29
        ]
      ]
    }
  ]
